---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="status-pill">
    <span class="status-dot"></span>
    <span>Tech Lead, OpenBanking @ PayPal &middot; Bengaluru, India</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Lakshmikant Deshpande</h1>
  <p class="hero-role">Staff Software Engineer &amp; Systems Builder</p>
  <div class="hero-bio">
    <p>I lead engineering for OpenBanking and payment platforms at <strong>PayPal</strong>, designing high-availability distributed systems that move money across global payment rails (SEPA, UK Open Banking, Paidy, and Boku).</p>
    <p>In my personal time, I build focused utilities, native Android apps, and practical AI tools that simplify code analysis and everyday tasks.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-links">
    <a class="hero-btn" href="#projects">Projects &darr;</a>
    <a class="hero-btn" href="#experience">Experience &darr;</a>
    <a class="hero-btn" href="/about/">About me &rarr;</a>
    <a class="hero-icon-link" href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="GitHub">
      {% include "icons/github.svg" %} <span>GitHub</span>
    </a>
    <a class="hero-icon-link" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn">
      {% include "icons/linkedin.svg" %} <span>LinkedIn</span>
    </a>
    <a class="hero-icon-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" aria-label="Email">
      {% include "icons/mail.svg" %} <span>Email</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="section work-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">INDEPENDENT SOFTWARE</span>
      <h2>Featured Projects</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/work/">View all projects <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
      {% if project.data.featured %}
        {% include 'project-card.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="experience" class="section experience-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">CAREER &amp; TRACK RECORD</span>
      <h2>Engineering Experience</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Full background <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="experience-list">
    <article class="experience-card">
      <div class="experience-icon-col">
        <div class="company-logo-badge paypal-badge">
          {% include "icons/paypal.svg" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="experience-content">
        <div class="experience-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="experience-role-title">Staff Software Engineer &amp; Tech Lead</h3>
            <span class="experience-company-name">PayPal &middot; OpenBanking &amp; Alternative Payments</span>
          </div>
          <span class="experience-date-pill current">2021 &mdash; Present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="experience-desc">Leading architecture for UK Open Banking Payment Initiation and alternative payment rails. Engineered high-throughput settlement systems for Paidy, SEPA recurring payments, and Boku integrations handling global transaction volume.</p>
        <div class="experience-tags">
          <span class="exp-tag">Java</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Distributed Systems</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Spring Boot</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Apache Kafka</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">OpenBanking</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Payment Rails</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="experience-card">
      <div class="experience-icon-col">
        <div class="company-logo-badge appzen-badge">
          {% include "icons/appzen.svg" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="experience-content">
        <div class="experience-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="experience-role-title">Software Engineer</h3>
            <span class="experience-company-name">AppZen &middot; Financial AI &amp; Audit Platform</span>
          </div>
          <span class="experience-date-pill">2018 &mdash; 2021</span>
        </div>
        <p class="experience-desc">Engineered backend microservices and asynchronous audit data pipelines for automated corporate spend compliance, invoice auditing, and fraud detection platforms.</p>
        <div class="experience-tags">
          <span class="exp-tag">Python</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Microservices</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">AWS</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Financial AI</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="experience-card">
      <div class="experience-icon-col">
        <div class="company-logo-badge clairvoyant-badge">
          {% include "icons/clairvoyant.svg" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="experience-content">
        <div class="experience-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="experience-role-title">Software Engineer</h3>
            <span class="experience-company-name">Clairvoyant &middot; Big Data &amp; Cloud Platforms</span>
          </div>
          <span class="experience-date-pill">2016 &mdash; 2018</span>
        </div>
        <p class="experience-desc">Built enterprise big data pipelines and distributed ingestion frameworks. Implemented real-time stream processing and data lake synchronization across cloud infrastructure.</p>
        <div class="experience-tags">
          <span class="exp-tag">Apache Spark</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Hadoop</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Kafka</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Big Data</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Data Ingestion</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="experience-card">
      <div class="experience-icon-col">
        <div class="company-logo-badge persistent-badge">
          {% include "icons/persistent.svg" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="experience-content">
        <div class="experience-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="experience-role-title">Software Engineer</h3>
            <span class="experience-company-name">Persistent Systems &middot; Enterprise Systems</span>
          </div>
          <span class="experience-date-pill">2014 &mdash; 2016</span>
        </div>
        <p class="experience-desc">Developed core enterprise backend components, data interfaces, and transactional REST APIs for mission-critical client applications.</p>
        <div class="experience-tags">
          <span class="exp-tag">Java</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Spring</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="exp-tag">Enterprise Architecture</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section toolkit-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">TECHNICAL CAPABILITIES</span>
      <h2>Systems &amp; Toolkit</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="toolkit-grid">
    <div class="toolkit-card">
      <h3 class="toolkit-title">Distributed Systems &amp; Payments</h3>
      <p class="toolkit-desc">High-throughput payment orchestration, OpenBanking APIs, transactional settlement pipelines, event-driven architectures, and high-availability financial infrastructure.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="toolkit-card">
      <h3 class="toolkit-title">Backend Architecture</h3>
      <p class="toolkit-desc">Java, Spring Boot, Python, Kotlin, Apache Kafka, relational &amp; NoSQL datastores, Docker, and resilient microservice design.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="toolkit-card">
      <h3 class="toolkit-title">App &amp; AI Prototyping</h3>
      <p class="toolkit-desc">Native Android development (Jetpack Compose), LLM-assisted code documentation (AST parsing), CLI tools, and rapid experimental prototyping.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section writing-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">FIELD NOTES</span>
      <h2>Writing &amp; Thoughts</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/writing/">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        {% include 'post-row.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <div class="writing-empty">
        <p class="empty-heading">Notebook just opened.</p>
        <p>Technical articles and notes on distributed systems, payment rails, and AI experimentation are in progress. Follow along via RSS.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/feed.xml">Subscribe with RSS <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">CONNECT</span>
      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-box">
    <p>Always happy to discuss distributed systems, payment platforms, independent tools, or software engineering in general. Drop me an email or find me online:</p>
    <div class="contact-methods">
      <a class="contact-pill" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
        {% include "icons/mail.svg" %} <span>{{ site.email }}</span>
      </a>
      <a class="contact-pill" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {% include "icons/linkedin.svg" %} <span>LinkedIn</span>
      </a>
      <a class="contact-pill" href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {% include "icons/github.svg" %} <span>GitHub</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
